  "prefLabel": "Plc 2005.01 Eligibility for Voluntary Certification Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2005.01 Eligibility for Voluntary Certification Renewal. To be eligible for renewal of a certification as a CHW, an individual shall:\n\n(a) Have completed the continuing education required by Plc 2004.03;\n\n(b) Have paid all administrative and civil penalties imposed, if any; and\n\n(c) Meet the eligibility for renewal criteria specified in Plc 308.02.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
